      "kind": "nav",
      "refersTo": "province-tab",
      "description": "深蓝省份面板的两项文字标签与黄铜下划线。",
      "html": "<div class=\"ds-tabs\" role=\"tablist\" aria-label=\"本省政务\"><button type=\"button\" role=\"tab\" aria-selected=\"true\" class=\"ds-tab\">奏报</button><button type=\"button\" role=\"tab\" aria-selected=\"false\" class=\"ds-tab\">批复</button></div>",
      "css": ".ds-tabs{display:flex;gap:18px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line-soft,rgba(208,170,90,.14));background:var(--panel-deep,#1a2f3d);padding:12px 16px 0}.ds-tab{font-family:var(--font,CourtSans,\"PingFang SC\",sans-serif);border:0;background:none;padding:0 0 8px;color:var(--muted,#c2b79c);font-size:13px;font-weight:600;cursor:pointer}.ds-tab[aria-selected=\"true\"]{color:var(--bright,#f2d58a);box-shadow:inset 0 -2px var(--brass,#d0aa5a)}.ds-tab:focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--bright,#f2d58a);outline-offset:2px;}"
    },
    {
      "name": "纸面传召芯片",
      "kind": "chip",
      "refersTo": "mention-chip",
      "description": "真实群成员的选中传召状态。",
      "html": "<button type=\"button\" class=\"ds-mention ds-mention-active\" aria-pressed=\"true\">@陆慎之</button>",
      "css": ".ds-mention{font-family:var(--font,CourtSans,\"PingFang SC\",sans-serif);font-size:11.5px;padding:3px 9px;border:1px solid rgba(120,95,45,.35);border-radius:6px;color:var(--paper-muted,#6d5d3d);background:rgba(255,255,255,.35);cursor:pointer}.ds-mention-active{color:#5b430d;border-color:rgba(140,110,55,.65);background:rgba(208,170,90,.34);font-weight:600}.ds-mention:focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--bright,#f2d58a);outline-offset:2px;}"
    },
    {
      "name": "深蓝框架卡片",
      "kind": "card",
      "refersTo": "navy-panel",
      "description": "顶部、侧栏和全国面板共享的渐变、黄铜边与短角饰。",
      "html": "<section class=\"ds-panel\"><h2 class=\"ds-panel-heading\">十五地简况</h2><p class=\"ds-panel-copy\">省份钱粮以实际奏报为准。</p></section>",
      "css": ".ds-panel{font-family:var(--font,CourtSans,\"PingFang SC\",sans-serif);position:relative;width:224px;background:linear-gradient(168deg,var(--panel,#23404f),var(--panel-low,#1d3543));color:var(--text,#f4ead6);border:1px solid rgba(208,170,90,.42);border-radius:14px;box-shadow:0 18px 44px -14px rgba(9,20,29,.6),0 3px 10px rgba(9,20,29,.28),inset 0 1px 0 rgba(246,235,209,.08);overflow:hidden}.ds-panel::before,.ds-panel::after{content:\"\";position:absolute;width:13px;height:13px;border-color:rgba(242,213,138,.5);border-style:solid;pointer-events:none}.ds-panel::before{left:7px;top:7px;border-width:1px 0 0 1px;border-top-left-radius:7px}.ds-panel::after{right:7px;bottom:7px;border-width:0 1px 1px 0;border-bottom-right-radius:7px}.ds-panel-heading{margin:0;padding:15px 16px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line-soft,rgba(208,170,90,.14));font-size:16px;font-weight:650}.ds-panel-copy{margin:0;padding:14px 16px;font-size:13px;color:var(--muted,#c2b79c)}"
    },
    {
      "name": "纸面对话框",
      "kind": "card",
      "refersTo": "paper-dialog",
      "description": "事件、人物和设置采用同一纸面容器；预览省略遮罩。",
      "html": "<section class=\"ds-dialog\" aria-label=\"河南奏报\"><header class=\"ds-dialog-head\"><h2>河南奏报</h2><button type=\"button\" class=\"ds-dialog-close\" aria-label=\"关闭\"><svg width=\"15\" height=\"15\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"><path d=\"M18 6 6 18M6 6l12 12\"/></svg></button></header><p class=\"ds-dialog-copy\">本轮尚无奏报呈递。</p></section>",
      "css": ".ds-dialog{font-family:var(--font,CourtSans,\"PingFang SC\",sans-serif);width:360px;background:linear-gradient(168deg,var(--paper,#f0e7d1),var(--paper-low,#e7dabd));color:var(--ink,#3a2f1f);border:1px solid var(--paper-border,rgba(120,95,45,.45));border-radius:16px;box-shadow:0 32px 80px -20px rgba(9,20,29,.62),inset 0 1px 0 rgba(255,255,255,.5);overflow:hidden}.ds-dialog-head{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:10px;padding:15px 20px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--paper-line,rgba(120,95,45,.22))}.ds-dialog-head h2{margin:0;font-size:17px;font-weight:650;color:#33291a}.ds-dialog-close{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;width:32px;height:32px;border:0;border-radius:8px;background:none;color:var(--paper-muted,#6d5d3d);cursor:pointer}.ds-dialog-close:hover{background:rgba(140,110,55,.14);color:#4a3710}.ds-dialog-close:focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--bright,#f2d58a);outline-offset:2px;}.ds-dialog-copy{margin:0;padding:18px 20px;font-size:13.5px;line-height:1.7}"
    },
    {
      "name": "十五地钱粮行",
      "kind": "nav",
      "refersTo": "overview-row",
      "description": "稳定身份色点、省名与银粮并列；预览不填演示金额。",
      "html": "<button type=\"button\" class=\"ds-overview-row\"><span class=\"ds-overview-name\"><i class=\"ds-province-dot\"></i>河南</span><span class=\"ds-overview-amount\"><span>银—</span><span>粮—</span></span></button>",
      "css": ".ds-overview-row{font-family:var(--font,CourtSans,\"PingFang SC\",sans-serif);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:8px;width:204px;padding:6px 9px;border-radius:8px;text-align:left;white-space:nowrap;font-size:12.5px;line-height:1.45;border:1px solid transparent;background:var(--panel-deep,#1a2f3d);color:#e8dfc9;cursor:pointer;transition:background 150ms ease,border-color 150ms ease}.ds-overview-row:hover{background:rgba(208,170,90,.1)}.ds-overview-row:focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--bright,#f2d58a);outline-offset:2px;}.ds-overview-name{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px}.ds-province-dot{display:inline-block;width:8px;height:8px;border-radius:50%;background:var(--province-sage,#8da98f)}.ds-overview-amount{display:flex;gap:6px;font-size:11px;color:var(--muted,#c2b79c);font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums}"
    },
    {
      "name": "左右奏对气泡",
      "kind": "custom",
      "refersTo": "agent-bubble",
      "description": "官员纸卡在左，君主深蓝气泡在右；保留相对的小尖角。",
      "html": "<div class=\"ds-messages\"><div class=\"ds-agent\"><small class=\"ds-sender\">陆慎之</small><p class=\"ds-bubble\">本轮尚无奏报呈递。</p></div><div class=\"ds-self\"><small class=\"ds-sender\">圣谕</small><p class=\"ds-bubble\">请据实奏报。</p></div></div>",
      "css": ".ds-messages{font-family:var(--font,CourtSans,\"PingFang SC\",sans-serif);display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:14px;width:340px;padding:18px 22px;background:linear-gradient(168deg,var(--paper,#f0e7d1),var(--paper-low,#e7dabd))}.ds-agent,.ds-self{max-width:84%}.ds-self{align-self:flex-end}.ds-sender{display:block;font-size:11px;color:var(--paper-muted,#6d5d3d);margin-bottom:4px}.ds-bubble{margin:0;padding:10px 14px;font-size:13.5px;line-height:1.7;overflow-wrap:anywhere;white-space:pre-wrap}.ds-agent .ds-bubble{background:var(--paper-card,#f8f2e2);border:1px solid rgba(120,95,45,.22);border-radius:3px 14px 14px 14px;color:#3a3123;box-shadow:0 2px 6px rgba(90,70,35,.08)}.ds-self .ds-bubble{background:linear-gradient(180deg,#2a4656,#20394b);color:var(--text,#f4ead6);border-radius:14px 3px 14px 14px;box-shadow:0 4px 14px rgba(40,30,15,.24),inset 0 1px 0 rgba(246,235,209,.12)}"
    }
  ],
  "narrative": {
    "northStar": "深蓝朝堂与纸面奏对",
    "overview": "两京十三省 HUD 采用 Kimi v4 已确认的视觉方向：连续地理底图上悬浮深蓝政务框架，中央御前密谈及受保护的对话框使用暖纸面。黄铜细线、短角饰和圆形人物画像建立朝堂识别；主要操作以朱红印章色收束。\n\n界面保持紧凑、清楚的桌面操作密度。地图提供地理上下文，左右信息栏保留省份和钱粮线索，中央承载当前会话或全国面板。全部中文界面共用本地 CourtSans 字体，依靠字号、字重和明暗区分层级。",
    "keyCharacteristics": [
      "深蓝顶部与等宽侧栏、暖纸面会话、黄铜细线及朱红主操作。",
      "固定比例中央窗口与独立的边缘栏位；宽屏增加地图留白。",
      "圆形人物画像、纵向联系人和环形群像；官员消息在左、君主消息在右。",
      "地图四个稳定底色表示政区身份；钱粮、灾情及未知状态用真实来源和文字表达。"
    ],
    "rules": [
      {
        "name": "The Material Rule",
        "body": "深蓝承载全局框架与全国政务，暖纸面承载会话和对话框；同一窗口内用对应材质的文字、分割线和输入控件。",
        "section": "colors"
      },
      {
        "name": "The Geography Rule",
        "body": "四个政区底色保持稳定，不随钱粮、灾情或调试状态改换省份身份色。",
        "section": "colors"
      },
      {
        "name": "The Local Type Rule",
        "body": "中文标题、正文、数字和地图标注均使用已随应用提供的 CourtSans，不另引入宋体标题体系。",
        "section": "typography"
      },
      {
        "name": "The Fixed Center Rule",
        "body": "中央窗口始终保持 4:3；宽屏只增加地图留白，不把中央窗口拉伸为流式大面板。",
        "section": "layout"
      }
    ],
    "dos": [
      "Do 保持顶部和两侧的深蓝框架、中央会话及对话框的暖纸面材质。",
      "Do 使用本地 CourtSans、对齐的数字和可追溯的奏报来源。",
      "Do 保持中央 4:3、两侧等宽、边缘留白与独立滚动区。",
      "Do 在纸面与深蓝面板分别使用对应的文字、线条和输入控件配色。",
      "Do 让地图政区、全国表格和右侧列表共用同一套四个身份底色。",
      "Do 清楚区分未奏报、冻结疆域、历史旧档与实际四轮终局。"
    ],
    "donts": [
      "Don't 恢复旧的全浅色面板、宋体标题或把灾情等级当作政区身份底色。",
      "Don't 在宽屏拉大中央窗口，或把桌面设计扩展为未经确认的移动端布局。",
      "Don't 将原型演示的人物、属性评分或钱粮数值写成真实游戏数据。",
      "Don't 用零值代替未知数值，或用终局标记普通历史归档。",
      "Don't 让全国面板替换左侧省份栏，或将联系人改为横向标签导航。"
    ]
  }
}
